{"unit_id":"FORGE-131__dsh-lan-pair#feature-1","repo":"FORGE-131/dsh-lan-pair","commit":"d0854949c4cf0730d860686b9fe1c3ac771316a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-pair 的功能「一次性配对码」：在 DSH 设置页开启配对后显示四位码，手机提交后获得长期配对凭据；配对码到期、成功使用或多次输错后窗口关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:106-168","lib/pairing.js:54-95","lib/index.js:260-284"]}
